Binary: linuxmuster-api7
Built-For-Profiles: noudeb
Architecture: source all
Version: 7.4.16
Distribution: lmn74
Urgency: medium
Maintainer: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Changed-By: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Description:
 linuxmuster-api7 - Api for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-api7 (7.4.16) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [security] [linbo] The onboot routes no longer return the
     "linbo:<password>" entry, the LINBO rsync password in clear, through
     linuxmuster-tools 7.4.20. Fix #51, reported by @TomlDev.
   * [linbo] DELETE /linbo/images/{image_name} removes the whole image
     directory, including files added by hand, and also works for an
     image whose .info is missing or incomplete, refused so far with a
     409. The same applies to the backup directory deleted by the backup
     route. See linuxmuster-tools#39, reported by @TomlDev.
   * [linbo] The linbo-remote log route reads the log of the host's last
     run, linuxmuster-linbo7 7.4.18 writing one log per run.
   * [passwords] Teachers can read the password constraints and the
     effective password policy. Fix #50, reported by @TomlDev.
   * [packaging] Depends on linuxmuster-tools7 (>= 7.4.20).
